{
  "info": {
    "name": "Mini ERP + CRM Operations Portal",
    "description": "Full API surface for the Mini ERP + CRM Operations Portal.\n\n## Getting started\n\n1. Import this collection and `Mini-ERP-CRM.postman_environment.json`.\n2. Select the environment and set `baseUrl` (local: `http://localhost:4000/api`).\n3. Run **Authentication → Login (Admin)** — the token is captured into `adminToken` automatically. The Sales, Warehouse and Accounts logins populate their own token variables.\n4. Run the folders in order. Requests store the ids they create (`customerId`, `productId`, `challanId`) so later requests need no manual editing.\n\n## Conventions\n\n- Success: `{ \"success\": true, \"data\": …, \"meta\"?: … }`\n- Failure: `{ \"success\": false, \"error\": { \"code\", \"message\", \"details\"? } }`\n- Protected routes need `Authorization: Bearer <token>`.\n\n## Roles\n\n| Role | Can do |\n|---|---|\n| ADMIN | everything |\n| SALES | customers, follow-ups, challans (create/confirm/cancel) |\n| WAREHOUSE | products, stock movements, challan confirmation |\n| ACCOUNTS | read-only across every module |",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:4000/api" },
    { "key": "password", "value": "Password@123" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Authentication",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login (Admin)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('returns a token and profile', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(body.success).to.be.true;",
                  "  pm.expect(body.data.token).to.be.a('string');",
                  "  pm.expect(body.data.user.role).to.eql('ADMIN');",
                  "});",
                  "pm.environment.set('adminToken', body.data.token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@minierp.com\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "login"] },
            "description": "Exchanges credentials for a JWT access token."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (Sales)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('role is SALES', () => pm.expect(body.data.user.role).to.eql('SALES'));",
                  "pm.environment.set('salesToken', body.data.token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"sales@minierp.com\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "login"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (Warehouse)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('role is WAREHOUSE', () => pm.expect(body.data.user.role).to.eql('WAREHOUSE'));",
                  "pm.environment.set('warehouseToken', body.data.token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"warehouse@minierp.com\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "login"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (Accounts)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('role is ACCOUNTS', () => pm.expect(body.data.user.role).to.eql('ACCOUNTS'));",
                  "pm.environment.set('accountsToken', body.data.token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"accounts@minierp.com\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "login"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login — invalid credentials (401)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('401 Unauthorized', () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));",
                  "pm.test('does not reveal which part was wrong', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().error.message).to.eql('Invalid email or password');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@minierp.com\",\n  \"password\": \"WrongPassword1\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "login"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login — validation error (422)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('422 Unprocessable Entity', () => pm.response.to.have.status(422));",
                  "pm.test('lists the offending fields', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().error.code).to.eql('VALIDATION_ERROR');",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().error.details).to.be.an('array');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"not-an-email\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "login"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Current user",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('includes the resolved permission set', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.user.permissions).to.be.an('array');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{adminToken}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/me", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "me"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Protected route without a token (401)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": ["pm.test('401 Unauthorized', () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));"]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/customers", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["customers"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Customers",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create customer",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const data = pm.response.json().data;",
                  "pm.test('normalises the input', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(data.mobile).to.match(/^[6-9]\\d{9}$/);",
                  "  pm.expect(data.email).to.eql(data.email.toLowerCase());",
                  "});",
                  "pm.environment.set('customerId', data.id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{salesToken}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Ritu Sharma\",\n  \"businessName\": \"Sharma Distributors\",\n  \"mobile\": \"9876543210\",\n  \"email\": \"ritu@sharmadist.in\",\n  \"gstNumber\": \"27AAECS1234F1Z5\",\n  \"type\": \"WHOLESALE\",\n  \"status\": \"LEAD\",\n  \"address\": \"221 Linking Road, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400050\",\n  \"followUpDate\": \"2026-09-15\",\n  \"notes\": \"Enquiry from the regional trade expo.\"\n}"
